@baseUrl = http://localhost:5301

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Database readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/ready

### Create trading account
# @name createAccount
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Trading Journal Test",
  "broker": "Fidelity",
  "mode": "PAPER",
  "currency": "USD"
}

# {
#   "id": "cfb0d9b2-3821-4a8b-94ca-a694832810a9",
#   "name": "Trading Journal Test",
#   "broker": "Fidelity",
#   "mode": "PAPER",
