### Get created account
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{createAccount.response.body.$.id}}

### Create trading campaign
# @name createCampaign
POST {{baseUrl}}/campaigns
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{createAccount.response.body.$.id}}",
  "name": "LRCX Options Strategy",
  "description": "Manual trading journal verification"
}

